{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54277","headline":"僧举香岩语示颂 · 本寂","name":"僧举香岩语示颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枯木龙吟真（《林间录》卷下作「方」）见道，髑髅无识（《祖庭事苑》卷二作「识尽」）眼初（《林间录》作「方」）明。\n喜识尽时消息（《景德传灯录》卷十七作「不」）尽，当（《僧宝传》卷一作「常」）人那辨浊中清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}